('srd35_magic_feather_falling','Feather falling','magic_item',2200,2200,'This ring is crafted with a feather pattern all around its edge. It acts exactly like a feather fall spell, activated immediately if the wearer falls more than 5 feet.','https://github.com/olimot/srd-v3.5-md/blob/main/magic-items/magic-items-iii-potions-rings-and-rods.md','rings','{"source_file":"magic-items-iii-potions-rings-and-rods.md","source_table":"Table: Rings","market_price":"2,200 gp","roll_result":"19–28 — —","raw_table_row":["19–28","—","—","Feather falling","2,200 gp"],"source_dataset":"olimot/srd-v3.5-md","license":"Open Game Content / OGL 1.0a","has_full_item_description":true}'::jsonb),
('srd35_magic_sustenance','Sustenance','magic_item',2500,2500,'This ring continually provides its wearer with life-sustaining nourishment. The ring also refreshes the body and mind, so that its wearer needs only sleep 2 hours per day to gain the benefit of 8 hours of sleep. The ring must be worn for a full week before it begins to work. If it is removed, the owner must wear it for another week to reattune it to himself.','https://github.com/olimot/srd-v3.5-md/blob/main/magic-items/magic-items-iii-potions-rings-and-rods.md','rings','{"source_file":"magic-items-iii-potions-rings-and-rods.md","source_table":"Table: Rings","market_price":"2,500 gp","roll_result":"29–36 — —","raw_table_row":["29–36","—","—","Sustenance","2,500 gp"],"source_dataset":"olimot/srd-v3.5-md","license":"Open Game Content / OGL 1.0a","has_full_item_description":true}'::jsonb),
('srd35_magic_climbing','Climbing','magic_item',2500,2500,'This ring is actually a magic leather cord that ties around a finger. It continually grants the wearer a +5 competence bonus on Climb checks.','https://github.com/olimot/srd-v3.5-md/blob/main/magic-items/magic-items-iii-potions-rings-and-rods.md','rings','{"source_file":"magic-items-iii-potions-rings-and-rods.md","source_table":"Table: Rings","market_price":"2,500 gp","roll_result":"37–44 — —","raw_table_row":["37–44","—","—","Climbing","2,500 gp"],"source_dataset":"olimot/srd-v3.5-md","license":"Open Game Content / OGL 1.0a","has_full_item_description":true}'::jsonb),
('srd35_magic_jumping','Jumping','magic_item',2500,2500,'This ring continually allows the wearer to leap about, providing a +5 competence bonus on all his Jump checks.','https://github.com/olimot/srd-v3.5-md/blob/main/magic-items/magic-items-iii-potions-rings-and-rods.md','rings','{"source_file":"magic-items-iii-potions-rings-and-rods.md","source_table":"Table: Rings","market_price":"2,500 gp","roll_result":"45–52 — —","raw_table_row":["45–52","—","—","Jumping","2,500 gp"],"source_dataset":"olimot/srd-v3.5-md","license":"Open Game Content / OGL 1.0a","has_full_item_description":true}'::jsonb),
('srd35_magic_swimming','Swimming','magic_item',2500,2500,'This silver ring has a wave pattern etched into the band. It continually grants the wearer a +5 competence bonus on Swim checks.','https://github.com/olimot/srd-v3.5-md/blob/main/magic-items/magic-items-iii-potions-rings-and-rods.md','rings','{"source_file":"magic-items-iii-potions-rings-and-rods.md","source_table":"Table: Rings","market_price":"2,500 gp","roll_result":"53–60 — —","raw_table_row":["53–60","—","—","Swimming","2,500 gp"],"source_dataset":"olimot/srd-v3.5-md","license":"Open Game Content / OGL 1.0a","has_full_item_description":true}'::jsonb),
('srd35_magic_counterspells','Counterspells','magic_item',4000,4000,'This ring might seem to be a ring of spell storing upon first examination. However, while it allows a single spell of 1st through 6th level to be cast into it, that spell cannot be cast out of the ring again. Instead, should that spell ever be cast upon the wearer, the spell is immediately countered, as a counterspell action, requiring no action (or even knowledge) on the wearer’s part. Once so used, the spell cast within the ring is gone. A new spell (or the same one as before) may be placed in it again.','https://github.com/olimot/srd-v3.5-md/blob/main/magic-items/magic-items-iii-potions-rings-and-rods.md','rings','{"source_file":"magic-items-iii-potions-rings-and-rods.md","source_table":"Table: Rings","market_price":"4,000 gp","roll_result":"61–70 01–05 —","raw_table_row":["61–70","01–05","—","Counterspells","4,000 gp"],"source_dataset":"olimot/srd-v3.5-md","license":"Open Game Content / OGL 1.0a","has_full_item_description":true}'::jsonb),
('srd35_magic_mind_shielding','Mind shielding','magic_item',8000,8000,'This ring is usually of fine workmanship and wrought from heavy gold. The wearer is continually immune to detect thoughts, discern lies, and any attempt to magically discern her alignment.','https://github.com/olimot/srd-v3.5-md/blob/main/magic-items/magic-items-iii-potions-rings-and-rods.md','rings','{"source_file":"magic-items-iii-potions-rings-and-rods.md","source_table":"Table: Rings","market_price":"8,000 gp","roll_result":"71–75 06–08 —","raw_table_row":["71–75","06–08","—","Mind shielding","8,000 gp"],"source_dataset":"olimot/srd-v3.5-md","license":"Open Game Content / OGL 1.0a","has_full_item_description":true}'::jsonb),
('srd35_magic_protection_2','Protection +2','magic_item',8000,8000,'Listed in Table: Rings; market price 8,000 gp. The specific item entry is not individually written out in this SRD table.','https://github.com/olimot/srd-v3.5-md/blob/main/magic-items/magic-items-iii-potions-rings-and-rods.md','rings','{"source_file":"magic-items-iii-potions-rings-and-rods.md","source_table":"Table: Rings","market_price":"8,000 gp","roll_result":"76–80 09–18 —","raw_table_row":["76–80","09–18","—","Protection +2","8,000 gp"],"source_dataset":"olimot/srd-v3.5-md","license":"Open Game Content / OGL 1.0a","has_full_item_description":false}'::jsonb),
('srd35_magic_force_shield','Force shield','magic_item',8500,8500,'An iron band, this simple ring generates a shield-sized (and shield-shaped) wall of force that stays with the ring and can be wielded by the wearer as if it were a heavy shield (+2 AC). This special creation has no armor check penalty or arcane spell failure chance since it is weightless and encumbrance-free. It can be activated and deactivated at will as a free action.','https://github.com/olimot/srd-v3.5-md/blob/main/magic-items/magic-items-iii-potions-rings-and-rods.md','rings','{"source_file":"magic-items-iii-potions-rings-and-rods.md","source_table":"Table: Rings","market_price":"8,500 gp","roll_result":"81–85 19–23 —","raw_table_row":["81–85","19–23","—","Force shield","8,500 gp"],"source_dataset":"olimot/srd-v3.5-md","license":"Open Game Content / OGL 1.0a","has_full_item_description":true}'::jsonb),
('srd35_magic_ram','Ram','magic_item',8600,8600,'The ring of the ram is an ornate ring forged of hard metal, usually iron or an iron alloy. It has the head of a ram as its device.','https://github.com/olimot/srd-v3.5-md/blob/main/magic-items/magic-items-iii-potions-rings-and-rods.md','rings','{"source_file":"magic-items-iii-potions-rings-and-rods.md","source_table":"Table: Rings","market_price":"8,600 gp","roll_result":"86–90 24–28 —","raw_table_row":["86–90","24–28","—","Ram","8,600 gp"],"source_dataset":"olimot/srd-v3.5-md","license":"Open Game Content / OGL 1.0a","has_full_item_description":true}'::jsonb),
('srd35_magic_climbing_improved','Climbing, improved','magic_item',10000,10000,'As climbing, except it grants a +10 competence bonus on its wearer’s Climb checks.','https://github.com/olimot/srd-v3.5-md/blob/main/magic-items/magic-items-iii-potions-rings-and-rods.md','rings','{"source_file":"magic-items-iii-potions-rings-and-rods.md","source_table":"Table: Rings","market_price":"10,000 gp","roll_result":"— 29–34 —","raw_table_row":["—","29–34","—","Climbing, improved","10,000 gp"],"source_dataset":"olimot/srd-v3.5-md","license":"Open Game Content / OGL 1.0a","has_full_item_description":true}'::jsonb),
