('srd35_magic_animal_friendship','Animal friendship','magic_item',10800,10800,'On command, this ring affects an animal as if the wearer had cast charm animal.','https://github.com/olimot/srd-v3.5-md/blob/main/magic-items/magic-items-iii-potions-rings-and-rods.md','rings','{"source_file":"magic-items-iii-potions-rings-and-rods.md","source_table":"Table: Rings","market_price":"10,800 gp","roll_result":"91–93 47–51 —","raw_table_row":["91–93","47–51","—","Animal friendship","10,800 gp"],"source_dataset":"olimot/srd-v3.5-md","license":"Open Game Content / OGL 1.0a","has_full_item_description":true}'::jsonb),
('srd35_magic_energy_resistance_minor','Energy resistance, minor','magic_item',12000,12000,'Listed in Table: Rings; market price 12,000 gp. The specific item entry is not individually written out in this SRD table.','https://github.com/olimot/srd-v3.5-md/blob/main/magic-items/magic-items-iii-potions-rings-and-rods.md','rings','{"source_file":"magic-items-iii-potions-rings-and-rods.md","source_table":"Table: Rings","market_price":"12,000 gp","roll_result":"94–96 50–56 01–02","raw_table_row":["94–96","50–56","01–02","Energy resistance, minor","12,000 gp"],"source_dataset":"olimot/srd-v3.5-md","license":"Open Game Content / OGL 1.0a","has_full_item_description":false}'::jsonb),
('srd35_magic_chameleon_power','Chameleon power','magic_item',12700,12700,'As a free action, the wearer of this ring can gain the ability to magically blend in with the surroundings. This provides a +10 competence bonus on her Hide checks. As a standard action, she can also command the ring to utilize the spell disguise self as often as she wants.','https://github.com/olimot/srd-v3.5-md/blob/main/magic-items/magic-items-iii-potions-rings-and-rods.md','rings','{"source_file":"magic-items-iii-potions-rings-and-rods.md","source_table":"Table: Rings","market_price":"12,700 gp","roll_result":"97–98 57–61 —","raw_table_row":["97–98","57–61","—","Chameleon power","12,700 gp"],"source_dataset":"olimot/srd-v3.5-md","license":"Open Game Content / OGL 1.0a","has_full_item_description":true}'::jsonb),
('srd35_magic_water_walking','Water walking','magic_item',15000,15000,'This ring, set with an opal, allows the wearer to continually utilize the effects of the spell water walk.','https://github.com/olimot/srd-v3.5-md/blob/main/magic-items/magic-items-iii-potions-rings-and-rods.md','rings','{"source_file":"magic-items-iii-potions-rings-and-rods.md","source_table":"Table: Rings","market_price":"15,000 gp","roll_result":"99–100 62–66 —","raw_table_row":["99–100","62–66","—","Water walking","15,000 gp"],"source_dataset":"olimot/srd-v3.5-md","license":"Open Game Content / OGL 1.0a","has_full_item_description":true}'::jsonb),
('srd35_magic_protection_3','Protection +3','magic_item',18000,18000,'Listed in Table: Rings; market price 18,000 gp. The specific item entry is not individually written out in this SRD table.','https://github.com/olimot/srd-v3.5-md/blob/main/magic-items/magic-items-iii-potions-rings-and-rods.md','rings','{"source_file":"magic-items-iii-potions-rings-and-rods.md","source_table":"Table: Rings","market_price":"18,000 gp","roll_result":"— 67–71 03–07","raw_table_row":["—","67–71","03–07","Protection +3","18,000 gp"],"source_dataset":"olimot/srd-v3.5-md","license":"Open Game Content / OGL 1.0a","has_full_item_description":false}'::jsonb),
('srd35_magic_spell_storing_minor','Spell storing, minor','magic_item',18000,18000,'A minor ring of spell storing contains up to three levels of spells that the wearer can cast. Each spell has a caster level equal to the minimum level needed to cast that spell. The user need not provide any material components or focus, or pay an XP cost to cast the spell, and there is no arcane spell failure chance for wearing armor (because the ring wearer need not gesture). The activation time for the ring is same as the casting time for the relevant spell, with a minimum of 1 standard action.','https://github.com/olimot/srd-v3.5-md/blob/main/magic-items/magic-items-iii-potions-rings-and-rods.md','rings','{"source_file":"magic-items-iii-potions-rings-and-rods.md","source_table":"Table: Rings","market_price":"18,000 gp","roll_result":"— 72–76 08–10","raw_table_row":["—","72–76","08–10","Spell storing, minor","18,000 gp"],"source_dataset":"olimot/srd-v3.5-md","license":"Open Game Content / OGL 1.0a","has_full_item_description":true}'::jsonb),
('srd35_magic_invisibility','Invisibility','magic_item',20000,20000,'By activating this simple silver ring, the wearer can benefit from invisibility, as the spell.','https://github.com/olimot/srd-v3.5-md/blob/main/magic-items/magic-items-iii-potions-rings-and-rods.md','rings','{"source_file":"magic-items-iii-potions-rings-and-rods.md","source_table":"Table: Rings","market_price":"20,000 gp","roll_result":"— 77–81 11–15","raw_table_row":["—","77–81","11–15","Invisibility","20,000 gp"],"source_dataset":"olimot/srd-v3.5-md","license":"Open Game Content / OGL 1.0a","has_full_item_description":true}'::jsonb),
