('srd35_magic_evasion','Evasion','magic_item',25000,25000,'This ring continually grants the wearer the ability to avoid damage as if she had evasion. Whenever she makes a Reflex saving throw to determine whether she takes half damage, a successful save results in no damage.','https://github.com/olimot/srd-v3.5-md/blob/main/magic-items/magic-items-iii-potions-rings-and-rods.md','rings','{"source_file":"magic-items-iii-potions-rings-and-rods.md","source_table":"Table: Rings","market_price":"25,000 gp","roll_result":"— 86–90 20–25","raw_table_row":["—","86–90","20–25","Evasion","25,000 gp"],"source_dataset":"olimot/srd-v3.5-md","license":"Open Game Content / OGL 1.0a","has_full_item_description":true}'::jsonb),
('srd35_magic_x_ray_vision','X-ray vision','magic_item',25000,25000,'On command, this ring gives its possessor the ability to see into and through solid matter. Vision range is 20 feet, with the viewer seeing as if he were looking at something in normal light even if there is no illumination. X-ray vision can penetrate 1 foot of stone, 1 inch of common metal, or up to 3 feet of wood or dirt. Thicker substances or a thin sheet of lead blocks the vision.','https://github.com/olimot/srd-v3.5-md/blob/main/magic-items/magic-items-iii-potions-rings-and-rods.md','rings','{"source_file":"magic-items-iii-potions-rings-and-rods.md","source_table":"Table: Rings","market_price":"25,000 gp","roll_result":"— 91–93 26–28","raw_table_row":["—","91–93","26–28","X-ray vision","25,000 gp"],"source_dataset":"olimot/srd-v3.5-md","license":"Open Game Content / OGL 1.0a","has_full_item_description":true}'::jsonb),
('srd35_magic_blinking','Blinking','magic_item',27000,27000,'On command, this ring makes the wearer blink, as with the blink spell.','https://github.com/olimot/srd-v3.5-md/blob/main/magic-items/magic-items-iii-potions-rings-and-rods.md','rings','{"source_file":"magic-items-iii-potions-rings-and-rods.md","source_table":"Table: Rings","market_price":"27,000 gp","roll_result":"— 94–97 29–32","raw_table_row":["—","94–97","29–32","Blinking","27,000 gp"],"source_dataset":"olimot/srd-v3.5-md","license":"Open Game Content / OGL 1.0a","has_full_item_description":true}'::jsonb),
